utes (1.2 miles) — this exactly matches the walking directions shown in Screenshot 5.\n\nBoth parts of the task were completed: the hotel name was correctly identified, and the walking time to the nearest supermarket was accurately determined with supporting visual evidence.\n\n**Verdict: SUCCESS**",
